{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2143_Renben_01_cv_text", "source": "High Priest... Hystan...", "translation": "Najwyższy Kapłan... Hystan...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2143_Renben_02_cv_text", "source": "The Blood Oath...", "translation": "Krwawa Przysięga...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2143_Santras_01_cv_text", "source": "Oh? What's this?", "translation": "O? A cóż to?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2143_Santras_02_cv_text", "source": "I wasn't aware such bold Daeva still remained.", "translation": "Nie sądziłem, że pozostali jeszcze tak zuchwali Daevowie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2143_Santras_03_cv_text", "source": "Finally, some real entertainment.", "translation": "Wreszcie jakaś prawdziwa rozrywka.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2143_Santras_04_cv_text", "source": "These Daeva are no fun to toy with anymore...", "translation": "Zabawa tymi Daevami już mnie nie bawi...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2143_Santras_05_cv_text", "source": "Let's see...", "translation": "Zobaczmy...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2143_Santras_06_cv_text", "source": "...if you can entertain me.", "translation": "...czy potrafisz mnie zabawić.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2144_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Hey!", "translation": "Hej!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2144_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Destruction Archon! Answer me!", "translation": "Archoncie Zniszczenia! Odpowiedz mi!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2144_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "There's still something more you can do for the high priest. You can help him.", "translation": "Wciąż możesz zrobić coś dla Najwyższego Kapłana. Możesz mu pomóc.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2144_Nemon_04_cv_text", "source": "Let's get you out of here first. We can talk later.", "translation": "Najpierw cię stąd wydostaniemy. Porozmawiamy później.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2144_Renben_01_cv_text", "source": "Ugh... Hystan...", "translation": "Ugh... Hystanie...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2144_Renben_02_cv_text", "source": "The Blood Oath... I'm unworthy...", "translation": "Krwawa Przysięga... Nie jestem jej godzien...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2144_Renben_03_cv_text", "source": "What can I… do…? I… I… Ugh…", "translation": "Co mam... zrobić...? J-J... Ugh...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2144_Renben_04_cv_text", "source": "I...", "translation": "Ja...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2144_Santras_01_cv_text", "source": "I won't be...", "translation": "Nie dam się...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2144_Santras_02_cv_text", "source": "...bested by... Daeva worms!", "translation": "...pokonać... Daevskim robakom!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Are you... a Destruction Archon?", "translation": "Czy jesteś... jednym z Archontów Zniszczenia?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Do you know where to find the high priest's Fafnite?", "translation": "Wiesz, gdzie znaleźć Fafnita Najwyższego Kapłana?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "We are searching for Zikel's Core.", "translation": "Szukamy Rdzenia Zikela.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Nemon_04_cv_text", "source": "Where can we find the high priest's Fafnite?", "translation": "Gdzie znajdziemy Fafnita Najwyższego Kapłana?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Nemon_05_cv_text", "source": "Oh? Go on.", "translation": "O? Mów dalej.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Nemon_06_cv_text", "source": "Why?", "translation": "Dlaczego?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Nemon_07_cv_text", "source": "You don't want revenge?", "translation": "Nie chcesz zemsty?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Nemon_08_cv_text", "source": "\"Atone for my sins\"...", "translation": "„Odpokutować za grzechy”...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_01_cv_text", "source": "That honorable title was once mine, yes...", "translation": "Tak, niegdyś nosiłem ten zaszczytny tytuł...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_02_cv_text", "source": "I have no right...", "translation": "Nie mam prawa...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_03_cv_text", "source": "I have no right... to that title anymore.", "translation": "Nie mam już prawa do tego tytułu.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_04_cv_text", "source": "I... I left High Priest Hystan behind...", "translation": "Z-Zostawiłem Najwyższego Kapłana Hystana...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_05_cv_text", "source": "I have forsaken the Blood Oath.", "translation": "Złamałem Krwawą Przysięgę.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_06_cv_text", "source": "Haah...", "translation": "Haah...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_07_cv_text", "source": "I have... a request.", "translation": "Mam... prośbę.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_08_cv_text", "source": "If I happen to die...", "translation": "Jeśli przyjdzie mi umrzeć...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_09_cv_text", "source": "Release my apparition at the Impetusium.", "translation": "Uwolnij moje widmo w Impetusium.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_10_cv_text", "source": "I... must atone for my sins.", "translation": "M-Muszę odpokutować za swoje grzechy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_11_cv_text", "source": "I witnessed the high priest massacre Daeva", "translation": "Widziałem, jak Najwyższy Kapłan mordował Daevów", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_12_cv_text", "source": "and burn down Moslan Forest.", "translation": "i podpalał Las Moslan.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_13_cv_text", "source": "All this from a distance, hidden...", "translation": "Wszystkiemu przyglądałem się z ukrycia...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_14_cv_text", "source": "Like a coward.", "translation": "Jak tchórz.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_15_cv_text", "source": "Please. Promise me.", "translation": "Proszę. Obiecaj mi.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_16_cv_text", "source": "Why bother?", "translation": "Po co?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_17_cv_text", "source": "There is only one path for me.", "translation": "Jest dla mnie tylko jedna droga.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_18_cv_text", "source": "Only the high priest knows where to find the Core of Zikel.", "translation": "Tylko Najwyższy Kapłan wie, gdzie znaleźć Rdzeń Zikela.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_19_cv_text", "source": "But there are important clues I can give you...", "translation": "Mogę jednak przekazać ci ważne wskazówki...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_20_cv_text", "source": "I have a hideout in the Basfelt Ruins.", "translation": "Mam kryjówkę w Ruinach Basfelt.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2150_Renben_21_cv_text", "source": "Search... through my papers there.", "translation": "Poszukaj... moich dokumentów.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2170_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Ugh!", "translation": "Ugh!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2170_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "This looks different from the one at Zikel's Sanctum.", "translation": "Ten wygląda inaczej niż ten z Sanktuarium Zikela.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2171_DstrArchon_01_cv_text", "source": "Destruction...", "translation": "Zniszczenia...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2171_DstrArchon_02_cv_text", "source": "Archons...", "translation": "Archonci...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2171_DstrArchon_03_cv_text", "source": "Honor the Blood Oath!", "translation": "Dochowajcie Krwawej Przysięgi!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2171_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "A Guardian Archon?", "translation": "Archont Strażnik?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_01_cv_text", "source": "Perfect.", "translation": "Doskonale.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_02_cv_text", "source": "Mmm...", "translation": "Mmm...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_03_cv_text", "source": "Not even your lovely scent remains in the air, Lady Nemon...", "translation": "Nawet twój cudowny zapach nie unosi się już w powietrzu, Pani Nemon...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_04_cv_text", "source": "You reek of blood.", "translation": "Pachniesz krwią.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_05_cv_text", "source": "Even this blood scent stimulates me.", "translation": "Nawet ten zapach krwi działa na mnie pobudzająco.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_06_cv_text", "source": "All the way here from Ishalgen...", "translation": "Przybyłaś aż z Ishalgen...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_07_cv_text", "source": "I could give you all that you desire, but you won't understand.", "translation": "Mógłbym dać ci wszystko, czego pragniesz, ale i tak tego nie zrozumiesz.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_08_cv_text", "source": "Ulgorn, Ulgorn...", "translation": "Ulgornie, Ulgornie...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_09_cv_text", "source": "Will you lay down your life in Nemon's place?", "translation": "Oddasz życie za Nemon?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_10_cv_text", "source": "You talk too much.", "translation": "Za dużo mówisz.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_11_cv_text", "source": "You talk too much.", "translation": "Za dużo mówisz.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_12_cv_text", "source": "This is why before humans learn to speak,", "translation": "Dlatego zanim ludzie nauczą się mówić,", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_13_cv_text", "source": "they ought to learn when their mouths are best kept shut.", "translation": "powinni nauczyć się, kiedy lepiej trzymać język za zębami.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_14_cv_text", "source": "Know your place, worm!", "translation": "Znaj swoje miejsce, robaku!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_15_cv_text", "source": "You are not even worthy of Ascension!", "translation": "Nie zasługujesz nawet na Wniebowstąpienie!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_16_cv_text", "source": "Hmph, Hystan prepared well for you.", "translation": "Hmph, Hystan dobrze cię przygotował.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_17_cv_text", "source": "He will be taken care of, in the warm embrace of Fafnite.", "translation": "Zajmie się nim Fafnit, otulając go ciepłym uściskiem.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_18_cv_text", "source": "Far more generous than the likes of him deserve, wouldn't you agree?", "translation": "To znacznie więcej, niż zasługuje ktoś taki jak on, nie sądzisz?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_19_cv_text", "source": "Consider what it takes to achieve your goal.", "translation": "Zastanów się, jak wiele wymaga osiągnięcie twojego celu.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Gerod_20_cv_text", "source": "There's no need to tread a path of thorns, Nemon.", "translation": "Nie musisz, Nemon, iść drogą usłaną cierniami.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Damn it... It's the fortress's defense mechanism!", "translation": "Cholera... Mechanizm obronny fortecy!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Aaaah!", "translation": "Aaa!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "Gerod...!", "translation": "Gerodzie...!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Nemon_04_cv_text", "source": "We have to get out of here!", "translation": "Musimy się stąd wydostać!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "Arrgghhh!", "translation": "Arrgghhh!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Ulgorn_02_cv_text", "source": "Gerod! You despicable bastard!", "translation": "Gerod! Ty podły draniu!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2173_Ulgorn_03_cv_text", "source": "You betrayed the Daeva, you filthy parasite!", "translation": "Parszywy pasożycie, zdrada Daevów to twoja sprawka!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2174_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Yes...", "translation": "Tak...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2174_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "The only way forward is to get rid of you.", "translation": "Jedyna droga naprzód prowadzi przez ciebie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2174_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "This ends here, Gerod!", "translation": "To koniec, Gerod!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2180_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "So much dust...", "translation": "Tyle kurzu...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2180_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "We're flirting with danger here.", "translation": "Igramy tu z niebezpieczeństwem.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2180_Snotra_01_cv_text", "source": "Look at the size of it!", "translation": "Ależ to wielkie!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2180_Snotra_02_cv_text", "source": "Get back.", "translation": "Cofnij się.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2180_Snotra_03_cv_text", "source": "It solidified! It worked!", "translation": "Zestaliło się! Udało się!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2190_AltKnife01_01_cv_text", "source": "Damn it!", "translation": "Cholera!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2190_AltKnife01_02_cv_text", "source": "All this swimming back and forth is killing me.", "translation": "To ciągłe pływanie tam i z powrotem wykończy mnie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2190_AltKnife01_03_cv_text", "source": "Why built the entrance at the bottom of a lake?", "translation": "Czemu wejście zbudowano na dnie jeziora?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2190_AltKnife02_01_cv_text", "source": "That lake is protecting us.", "translation": "To jezioro nas chroni.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2190_AltKnife02_02_cv_text", "source": "Now quit complaining and get moving!", "translation": "Przestań narzekać i ruszaj się!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2190_Decker_01_cv_text", "source": "Are the Shulak here yet?", "translation": "Shulakowie już tu są?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2190_Decker_02_cv_text", "source": "When are they planning to bring the gemstones?", "translation": "Kiedy zamierzają dostarczyć klejnoty?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2190_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Yes... Loud and clear.", "translation": "Tak... Słyszę cię wyraźnie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2202_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Ulgorn...", "translation": "Ulgornie...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2203_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "Let's go.", "translation": "Chodźmy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2203_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "Urgh...", "translation": "Urgh...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2210_Gerod_01_cv_text", "source": "Nemon, our relationship didn't need to turn out this way.", "translation": "Nemon, nie musiało się tak między nami skończyć.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2210_Gerod_02_cv_text", "source": "Oh, but did I not already give you... something better?", "translation": "Ale czy nie dałem ci już... czegoś lepszego?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2210_Gerod_03_cv_text", "source": "Hah, Nemon... Nemon!", "translation": "Ha, Nemon... Nemon!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2210_Gerod_04_cv_text", "source": "Can't you understand? I'm the only one who can help you!", "translation": "Nie rozumiesz? Tylko ja mogę ci pomóc!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2210_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Where is the Fafnite? Gerod, tell me.", "translation": "Gdzie jest Fafnit? Gerod, mów.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2210_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Enough of your stupid jokes.", "translation": "Dość tych głupich żartów.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2210_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "You chose this fate for yourself.", "translation": "Ten los jest twoim własnym wyborem.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2210_Nemon_04_cv_text", "source": "If you won't talk, I'll have to force it out of you.", "translation": "Jeśli nie będziesz mówić, wydobędę to z ciebie siłą.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2211_Gerod_01_cv_text", "source": "Arch Daeva...", "translation": "Arcydaev...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2211_Gerod_02_cv_text", "source": "If you're an Arch Daeva, then I...!", "translation": "Jeśli masz rangę Arcydaevy, to ja...!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2211_Gerod_03_cv_text", "source": "Nemon!", "translation": "Nemon!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2211_Gerod_04_cv_text", "source": "You cannot leave me!", "translation": "Nie możesz mnie zostawić!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2211_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Is this all you can do, Gerod?", "translation": "Tylko na tyle cię stać, Gerod?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2212_Gerod_01_cv_text", "source": "So, this is how it ends.", "translation": "A więc tak to się skończy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2212_Gerod_02_cv_text", "source": "Is this the price I pay... for desiring you?", "translation": "Czy to cena, którą płacę... za to, że cię pragnąłem?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2212_Gerod_03_cv_text", "source": "I did it all for you...but you...", "translation": "Zrobiłem to wszystko dla ciebie... a ty...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2212_Gerod_04_cv_text", "source": "...Gah...", "translation": "...Ty...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2212_Gerod_05_cv_text", "source": "You vicious witch...", "translation": "Ty podła wiedźmo...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2212_Gerod_06_cv_text", "source": "Gah, ugh...", "translation": "Gah, ugh...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2212_Gerod_07_cv_text", "source": "It's been taken... the Mau...", "translation": "Zabrano... Mau...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2212_Gerod_08_cv_text", "source": "For you... there will be no paradise...", "translation": "Dla ciebie... nie będzie raju...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2212_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Speak.", "translation": "Mów.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2212_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Where is the Fafnite?", "translation": "Gdzie jest Fafnit?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2220_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "We finally found it...", "translation": "Wreszcie go znaleźliśmy...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2220_None_01_cv_text", "source": "What's happening?", "translation": "Co się dzieje?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2221_Indnah_01_cv_text", "source": "You dare touch my collection...", "translation": "Śmiesz tknąć moją kolekcję...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2221_Indnah_02_cv_text", "source": "Commence the hunt.", "translation": "Rozpocząć polowanie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2221_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Now's our chance, hurry!", "translation": "Teraz nasza szansa, szybko!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_01_cv_text", "source": "Urgh...", "translation": "Urgh...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_02_cv_text", "source": "The Fafnite... Am I... free?", "translation": "Fafnit... Czy mogę... odejść?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_03_cv_text", "source": "You... You're not... Destruction Archons...", "translation": "Wy... Nie jesteście... Archontami Zniszczenia...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_04_cv_text", "source": "Why do you seek the Empyrean Lord's Core, Daeva?", "translation": "Dlaczego szukasz Rdzenia Władcy Empirian, Daevie?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_05_cv_text", "source": "Salvation...?", "translation": "Ocalenie...?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_06_cv_text", "source": "Is that permitted to us?", "translation": "Czy nam wolno je otrzymać?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_07_cv_text", "source": "I fought and I fought without end...", "translation": "Walczyłem bez końca...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_08_cv_text", "source": "...but salvation never came.", "translation": "...ale ocalenie nigdy nie nadeszło.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_09_cv_text", "source": "It is within...", "translation": "Jest w...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_10_cv_text", "source": "the Impetusium Barrier.", "translation": "Barierze Impetusium.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_11_cv_text", "source": "My apparition shall guide you through it.", "translation": "Moje widmo cię przez nią poprowadzi.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_12_cv_text", "source": "I wish to rest... within the Impetusium...", "translation": "Chcę spocząć...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_13_cv_text", "source": "as a Destruction Archon...", "translation": "w Impetusium...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_14_cv_text", "source": "beside Empyrean Lord Zikel.", "translation": "u boku Władcy Empirian Zikela.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_15_cv_text", "source": "My Empyrean Lord, to you I swear...", "translation": "Mój Władco Empirian, przysięgam ci...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Histan_16_cv_text", "source": "...my final oath.", "translation": "...ostatnią przysięgę.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "High Priest, you have returned.", "translation": "Najwyższy Kapłanie, wróciłeś.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "For Atreia.... to bring the salvation it deserves.", "translation": "Dla Atrei... by przynieść jej należne ocalenie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "Of course it is! Would you disagree?", "translation": "Oczywiście, że tak! Nie zgadzasz się?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Nemon_04_cv_text", "source": "Where is the Empyrean Lord Zikel's Core?", "translation": "Gdzie jest Rdzeń Władcy Empirian Zikela?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Nemon_05_cv_text", "source": "Please, you must answer me.", "translation": "Proszę, musisz odpowiedzieć.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2230_Urd_01_cv_text", "source": "High Priest Hystan! Can you hear me?", "translation": "Najwyższy Kapłanie Hystanie! Słyszysz mnie?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2241_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Zikel, I am here for your Core.", "translation": "Zikielu, przybywam po twój Rdzeń.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2241_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "We need your power to save Asmodae.", "translation": "Potrzebujemy twojej mocy, by ocalić Asmodae.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2241_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "He wished only to stay by your side.", "translation": "Pragnął jedynie pozostać u twojego boku.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2241_Nemon_04_cv_text", "source": "Do you believe otherwise?", "translation": "Naprawdę sądzisz inaczej?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2241_Spirit_01_cv_text", "source": "I will uphold the Blood Oath!", "translation": "Dochowam Krwawej Przysięgi!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2241_Zikel_01_cv_text", "source": "You're not Hystan.", "translation": "Nie jesteś Hystanem.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2241_Zikel_02_cv_text", "source": "Identify yourself.", "translation": "Przedstaw się.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2241_Zikel_03_cv_text", "source": "Were you sent by Fafnir?", "translation": "Przysłał cię Fafnir?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2241_Zikel_04_cv_text", "source": "Hystan must have chosen annihilation.", "translation": "Hystan musiał wybrać zagładę.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2241_Zikel_05_cv_text", "source": "Are you worthy of the core?", "translation": "Czy zasługujesz na Rdzeń?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2241_Zikel_06_cv_text", "source": "Are you prepared to shed blood for it?", "translation": "Czy masz odwagę przelać za niego krew?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2241_Zikel_07_cv_text", "source": "Prove yourself!", "translation": "Udowodnij swoją wartość!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2241_Zikel_08_cv_text", "source": "Show me the warrior within!", "translation": "Pokaż, jakim jesteś wojownikiem!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2241_Zikel_09_cv_text", "source": "You, too, will be bound to guard this place for eternity.", "translation": "Ciebie również na wieczność zwiąże obowiązek strzeżenia tego miejsca.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2242_Histan_01_cv_text", "source": "We must honor...", "translation": "Musimy dochować...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2242_Histan_02_cv_text", "source": "...the Blood Oath!", "translation": "...Krwawą Przysięgę!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2242_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Is it over?", "translation": "Czy to już koniec?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2242_Ruben_01_cv_text", "source": "I will uphold the Blood Oath!", "translation": "Dochowam Krwawej Przysięgi!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2243_Zikel_01_cv_text", "source": "Are you ready to face the God of Destruction?", "translation": "Czy masz odwagę stawić czoła Bogu Zniszczenia?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2243_Zikel_02_cv_text", "source": "Prove your worth before my blade.", "translation": "Udowodnij swoją wartość przed moim ostrzem.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2244_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "The deed is done. Is there anything else to prove?", "translation": "Czyn został dokonany. Czy pozostało jeszcze coś do udowodnienia?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2244_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Then please... Please give us the core.", "translation": "A więc proszę... Proszę, przekaż nam Rdzeń.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2244_Zikel_01_cv_text", "source": "You are no ordinary Daeva.", "translation": "Nie należysz do zwykłych Daevów.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2244_Zikel_02_cv_text", "source": "The core is only a vessel for power.", "translation": "Rdzeń jest jedynie naczyniem na moc.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2244_Zikel_03_cv_text", "source": "It is what you do with that power that truly matters.", "translation": "Liczy się to, co zrobisz z tą mocą.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2244_Zikel_04_cv_text", "source": "Protect Atreia.", "translation": "Chroń Atreię.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2244_Zikel_05_cv_text", "source": "Bring low the Balaur.", "translation": "Rzuć Balaurów na kolana.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2244_Zikel_06_cv_text", "source": "Deliver triumph unto Asmodae...", "translation": "Zapewnij triumf Asmodae...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2245_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "All that's left now here is you.", "translation": "Teraz nie ma tu już nikogo poza tobą.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2245_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "I'll be heading to Morheim.", "translation": "Teraz ruszam do Morheim.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2245_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "I need to find Marchutan's Core.", "translation": "Muszę odnaleźć Rdzeń Marchutana.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2245_Nemon_04_cv_text", "source": "What about you?", "translation": "A co z tobą?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2245_Nemon_05_cv_text", "source": "The Bulwark stands at the end of Morheim.", "translation": "Wał Obronny znajduje się na krańcu Morheim.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2245_Nemon_06_cv_text", "source": "So, will you accompany me there?", "translation": "Wyruszysz tam ze mną?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2245_Nemon_07_cv_text", "source": "It's funny.", "translation": "To zabawne.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2245_Nemon_09_cv_text", "source": "I will reshape this world.", "translation": "Ukształtuję ten świat na nowo.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2245_Nemon_10_cv_text", "source": "Both inside and outside the Bulwark,", "translation": "Zarówno za Wałem Obronnym, jak i przed nim,", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2245_Nemon_11_cv_text", "source": "I will change everything.", "translation": "zmienię wszystko.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2271_Hugo_01_cv_text", "source": "Damn it, find the Red Fafnite first!", "translation": "Cholera, najpierw znajdź Czerwonego Fafnita!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2272_Hugo_01_cv_text", "source": "Did the broker send you here...?", "translation": "To broker cię tu przysłał...?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2272_Hugo_02_cv_text", "source": "Yes, but I didn't expect there to be a traitor...", "translation": "Tak, ale nie spodziewałem się zdrajcy...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2272_Hugo_03_cv_text", "source": "It was not something... that we could handle.", "translation": "Nie byliśmy w stanie... sobie z tym poradzić.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2272_Hugo_04_cv_text", "source": "The storage room...", "translation": "Pomieszczenie magazynowe...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2272_Hugo_05_cv_text", "source": "Please rescue any survivors you find.", "translation": "Proszę, uratuj ocalałych, których znajdziesz.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2272_Hugo_06_cv_text", "source": "Because... you're a Daeva...", "translation": "Bo... należysz do Daevów...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2272_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "So you're also searching for the high priest's Fafnite?", "translation": "Ty też szukasz Fafnita Najwyższego Kapłana?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2272_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Why waste my time?", "translation": "Po co marnować mój czas?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2273_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "...Still alive?", "translation": "...Wciąż żyjesz?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2274_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Get up.", "translation": "Wstawaj.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2274_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Do you know where the Red Fafnite is?", "translation": "Wiesz, gdzie jest Czerwony Fafnit?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2275_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "What's that...?", "translation": "Co to...?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2275_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Damn it! The Fafnite's gone.", "translation": "Cholera! Fafnit zniknął.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2275_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "Hurry! The Fafnite!", "translation": "Szybko! Fafnit!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2276_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Follow me if you want to live!", "translation": "Chodź za mną, jeśli chcesz przeżyć!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2280_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "You're still alive?", "translation": "Wciąż żyjesz?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2280_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "I have a lot of questions, but we can't stick around.", "translation": "Mam mnóstwo pytań, ale nie możemy tu zostać.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2280_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "There's a village nearby. Make your way there.", "translation": "Niedaleko jest wioska. Spróbuj tam dotrzeć.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2280_Nemon_04_cv_text", "source": "Find me in Altgard if you survive.", "translation": "Jeśli przeżyjesz, znajdź mnie w Altgardzie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2280_Nemon_05_cv_text", "source": "Name's Nemon.", "translation": "Jestem Nemon.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2280_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "The Balaur are tightening their defenses, Nemon.", "translation": "Balaurzy wzmacniają obronę, Nemon.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2280_Ulgorn_02_cv_text", "source": "We're at our limit. Get out of here now!", "translation": "Nie damy już rady. Uciekaj stąd, natychmiast!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2300_Hergall_01_cv_text", "source": "Get up, now!", "translation": "Wstawaj, już!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2300_Hergall_02_cv_text", "source": "They're all mind-controlled by Fafnir!", "translation": "Fafnir przejął kontrolę nad umysłami wszystkich!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2300_Hergall_03_cv_text", "source": "Run away...!", "translation": "Uciekaj...!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2310_Asar_01_cv_text", "source": "Spread your wings and soar!", "translation": "Rozwiń skrzydła i leć!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2320_Indnah_01_cv_text", "source": "There you are.", "translation": "A więc jesteś.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2320_Indnah_02_cv_text", "source": "Did you think", "translation": "Czy naprawdę sądzisz,", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2320_Indnah_03_cv_text", "source": "you'd really get away with stealing my Fafnite?", "translation": "że ujdzie ci na sucho kradzież mojego Fafnita?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2320_Indnah_04_cv_text", "source": "Insolent Daeva!", "translation": "Co za zuchwałość, Daevie!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2320_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Skuld, Verdandi!", "translation": "Skuld, Verdandi!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2320_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Indnath!", "translation": "Indnath!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2321_Indnah_01_cv_text", "source": "Enough games.", "translation": "Dość tych gierek.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2321_Indnah_02_cv_text", "source": "Your soul is mine.", "translation": "Twoja dusza należy do mnie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2321_Kromede_01_cv_text", "source": "Wherever you go,", "translation": "Gdziekolwiek pójdziesz,", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2321_Kromede_02_cv_text", "source": "trouble always follows, huh?", "translation": "zawsze ściągasz na siebie kłopoty, co?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2321_Kromede_03_cv_text", "source": "May we consider the debt paid?", "translation": "Możemy uznać dług za spłacony?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2321_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Kromede!", "translation": "Kromede!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2322_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "The chill of Morheim...", "translation": "Chłód Morheim...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2322_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "I need to stop by somewhere first.", "translation": "Najpierw muszę gdzieś wstąpić.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2323_Kromede_01_cv_text", "source": "Shit...", "translation": "Cholera...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2323_Kromede_02_cv_text", "source": "Get him, Valter!", "translation": "Dorwać go, Valter!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2323_Kromede_03_cv_text", "source": "After them, Valter!", "translation": "Za nimi, Valter!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2323_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Is that... Kro...mede...?", "translation": "Czy to... Kro...mede...?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2323_Stophe_01_cv_text", "source": "Surrender, Kromede!", "translation": "Poddaj się, Kromede!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2323_Stophe_02_cv_text", "source": "Another of Kromede's servants?", "translation": "Kolejny sługa Kromede?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2323_Walter_01_cv_text", "source": "VAAAALTER!", "translation": "VAAAALTER!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2323_Walter_02_cv_text", "source": "VAAAAAL!", "translation": "VAAAAAL!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2323_Walter_03_cv_text", "source": "Valter!", "translation": "Valter!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2324_Kromede_01_cv_text", "source": "Valter, enough.", "translation": "Valter, wystarczy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2324_Kromede_02_cv_text", "source": "You know me? Hah... the price of fame.", "translation": "Znasz mnie? Ha... cena sławy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2324_Kromede_03_cv_text", "source": "Looking for the Nornir, right? Try Patamor Village.", "translation": "Szukasz Nornir, prawda? Spróbuj w Wiosce Patamor.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2324_Kromede_04_cv_text", "source": "Consider this thanks for the help. You're welcome.", "translation": "Potraktuj to jako podziękowanie za pomoc. Nie ma za co.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2324_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Kromede...", "translation": "Kromede...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2324_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "What are you doing here?", "translation": "Co tu robisz?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2324_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "How did you know?", "translation": "Skąd wzięła się ta wiedza?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2324_Stophe_01_cv_text", "source": "Curse you... Kromede.", "translation": "Przeklęta Kromede.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2330_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "A Fate Archon...", "translation": "Archont Losu...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2331_Kromede_01_cv_text", "source": "Now it's two on one.", "translation": "Teraz jest nas dwoje na jednego.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2340_Asar_01_cv_text", "source": "It is time.", "translation": "Nadeszła pora.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2340_Kromede_01_cv_text", "source": "Your only fate is handing over that Artifact and dying.", "translation": "Twój los jest przesądzony: oddasz Artefakt i zginiesz.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2340_Kromede_02_cv_text", "source": "You're nothing more than Fafnir's dog.", "translation": "Jesteś tylko psem Fafnira.", "status": "draft"}
